TITLE Mix 50 mmol/kg DIC with 50 mmol/kg Ca 1:1; heat 20 to 200 C in 10 steps; allow calcite ppt/dissolve

SOLUTION 1 DIC solution
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50 as HCO3

SOLUTION 2 Ca solution
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
SAVE solution 10

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_heat_calcite.sel
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step temp moles_calcite
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, TC, EQUI("Calcite")

END
